OL,3,GNEWSANo fines handed out in first month
OL,4,Aof balaclava ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo fines have been handed out since a
OL,7,Fban on balaclavas in Nottingham city
OL,8,Fcentre came into force last month, but
OL,9,Fpolice believe this shows "the message
OL,10,Fis getting through".
OL,12,FNottingham became one of the first
OL,13,Fcities in the UK to introduce
OL,14,Frestrictions on balaclavas on 15
OL,15,FSeptember, allowing authorities to ask
OL,16,Fpeople to take them off if they
OL,17,F"reasonably believe" they are being
OL,18,Fused to commit crime or anti-social
OL,19,Fbehaviour - with anyone refusing facing
OL,20,Fa #70 fine.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
