OL,3,GNEWSANo fines handed out in first month
OL,4,Aof balaclava ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottinghamshire Police said officers
OL,7,Fhad stopped two people in the first
OL,8,Fmonth.
OL,10,FCity commander Supt Chris Pearson said
OL,11,Fthe ban itself had led to fewer people
OL,12,Fwearing masks and the lack of fines
OL,13,Fshowed it was working as a deterrent.
